  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Department of Defense, Institutional Capacity Building Programs: Defense Institution Reform Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chad - Defense Management Initiative and Logistics #6. Conduct a 2-day logistics planning symposium establishing two joint groups assigned different operational scenarios. Bring together multi-service sustainment and operational leaders to learn a five-step planning process and establish the logistics concept of support planning baseline effort. Conduct an EMAA operational policy, plan, and strategy review with the Chief of Staff and other key staff. Conduct formal meeting with the SATG Commanding General to fully discuss logistics planning workshops designed to train and shape SATG operational requirements driving sustainment practices.</narrative>
  </description>
